{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-01_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-01","title":"战术阻滞","storyCode":"TR-11","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e3cbb79add47313df18b43bbb292198dceed34d710f6efc772aea3247687e134","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"接踵而至的任务并没有给博士太多休息的时间。\n在切城的行动后，罗德岛收到了龙门的合作协议，下一步无疑需要前往龙门了。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十三关（前）\n5:57 a.m. \\ 多云 \\ 能见度 17公里\n龙门外环外4公里，荒漠\n切尔诺伯格营救行动 结束后4天"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_2_call"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}, 早上好。您已经休息了99999999————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我知道您很不愿意起床，不过有人需要您立刻前往作战会议室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外来自凯尔希医生的医学建议，希望您多开窗保持通风，并且进入甲板晒太阳以平衡维生素D。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是博士！早啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}博士，你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士身体好些了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天看你好像还有些伤痛，行动不太方便。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我已经完全恢复了。你呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉今天活力满满的，已经没什么问题了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟接下来，我们还有别的任务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"需要早点做好准备。博士也要把快速调整当成常态哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我们在切城的行动，虽然遭受了很大损失，但是获得了不少关于整合运动的情报，而且还救出了博士您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"根据昨天会谈的结果，我们最近的移动城市————“龙门”，已向我们发送了一份合作框架协议，同意与我们交换情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"而有迹象显示“龙门”已经成为整合运动下一个行动目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"关于其他的内容，还需经过尚在龙门城内的凯尔希医生同意后，才能定下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门暂时答应了我们停泊在城市附近的要求，然后他们愿意给予一部分我们在行动中损失的物资，以及消耗的补给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"作为交换，罗德岛需要协助龙门，进行城市外环的一些临时性防卫工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不过今天这么早是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我来说吧，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"从昨天晚上开始，又有一波切尔诺伯格的幸存者在荒野中被发现，他们正在移动前往龙门，预计下午到达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"和之前几天一样，我们仍然需要对龙门5区的外围进行防卫工作，只不过这次，可能会混入更多的整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"战况有所不同，我们在出发之前需要告诉您一种新的战术策略。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那么博士，今天还请多多指教......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"加油！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请你们各自完成出发前的准备。博士请把准备好的编队配置命令下达给其他干员，让他们做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"完成演习后15分钟出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这次，千万不要迟到。"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]}]}
